    },
    {
      "id": "3",
      "images": 1,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n",
      "type": "block docx-image-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "4",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "首先确保相关的key填写正确",
      "type": "block docx-heading1-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "5",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n",
      "type": "block docx-fallback-block fallback-async-iframe fallback-async-align-"
    },
    {
      "id": "6",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "目前遇到出现这个问题的有以下几种情况",
      "type": "block docx-heading1-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "7",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "1.未关闭系统代理",
      "type": "block docx-heading2-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "8",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "开了代理会无法连接阿里云，导致出现这种情况，关了代理就好了。",
      "type": "block docx-text-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "9",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "可以在运行fay控制器前，先运行test文件夹下的“clear_proxy.py”关闭系统代理：",
      "type": "block docx-text-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "10",
      "images": 1,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n",
      "type": "block docx-image-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "11",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "2.麦克风无法使用",
      "type": "block docx-heading2-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "12",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "检查麦克风是否能正常使用；",
      "type": "block docx-text-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "13",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "可以使用查一下麦克风的信息，阿里云api仅支持'maxInputChannels'为'1的麦克风。",
      "type": "block docx-text-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "14",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "可以运行test文件夹下的“testpyaudio.py”查询麦克风：",
      "type": "block docx-text-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "15",
      "images": 1,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n",
      "type": "block docx-image-block"
    },
